meta {
  name: Nearby Search
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/places?lat=37.7749&lng=-122.4194&accuracy=25
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  lat: 37.7749
  lng: -122.4194
  accuracy: 25
}

docs {
  Nearby places around San Francisco from the `places` table: the twenty
  nearest, followed by large venues (parks, airports, stadiums...) within at
  least 2 km that were not already listed. Empty until Overture data for the
  area has been imported (see SETUP.md) or someone has created a venue there.

  `accuracy` is the phone's horizontal accuracy in meters; above 1000 the
  nearest-first search is skipped and only large venues are returned.
}
